∇ lines←RefEvents paste;courses;ddmm;k;c;sum;desc;s;e;d;t0;t1
 ⍝ Every class meeting the paste describes, as sorted EventLines, using Templates.
  courses←RefParse paste
  ddmm←RefDateFormat courses
  lines←⍬
  :For k :In courses
      :For c :In k.classes
          :If 0=≢c.starttime ⋄ :Continue ⋄ :EndIf     ⍝ TBA: nothing to put in a calendar
          sum desc←(k.code c.section k.name c.component c.room c.instructor)∘Fill¨Templates
          s e←ddmm∘DayNum¨c.(start end)
          d←(s-1)+⍳1+e-s
          d←d/⍨(7|d)∊WeekDays c.days
          t0 t1←Minutes¨c.(starttime endtime)
          lines,←{EventLine ⍵ t0 t1 sum desc}¨d,⍬
      :EndFor
  :EndFor
  lines←lines[⍋lines]
∇
